ets.mp4","poster","/GameMap/media/showcase/recording-hunyuan3d-assets.webp","aspectRatio",2.2641509433962264,"mobile","previewSrc","Preview description","Two generated textured 3D characters on a pink ground, preserved from the official Hunyuan3D 2.0 animation.","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Related project",[92],"resourceId",{"_49":93,"_26":94},"Hunyuan3D 2.0","/resources/hunyuan3d-2/","What this recording shows","An official asset-generation results animation, not gameplay or a running game scene. The original animated GIF is converted with its own frame timing; generation was not reproduced and game-ready topology, rigging, collision and runtime performance were not tested.","limitations","Demo category","Asset generation","demoType","lead","source-recording","assets","3d","recordingId","hunyuan3d-2","resource:hunyuan3d-2","resource","Turns reference images into geometry and textures for 3D asset pipelines.","/resources/",{"_20":106,"_191":93,"_189":104,"_47":192,"_190":109,"_184":183,"_26":134,"_57":193,"_163":194,"_159":195,"_156":196,"_150":197,"_147":146},[114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126,127,128],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":93,"_53":191,"_55":-7},{"_47":101,"_51":109,"_53":190,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":187,"_51":188,"_53":189,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":185,"_51":186,"_53":47,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":182,"_51":183,"_53":184,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":179,"_59":180,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":57,"_49":168,"_59":169,"_53":57,"_55":-7},{"_47":151,"_49":161,"_153":154,"_59":162,"_53":163,"_55":-7},{"_47":151,"_49":157,"_153":154,"_59":158,"_53":159,"_55":-7},{"_47":151,"_49":152,"_153":154,"_59":155,"_53":156,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":148,"_51":149,"_53":150,"_55":88},{"_47":48,"_49":145,"_51":146,"_53":147,"_55":88},{"_47":138,"_53":139,"_49":140,"_70":141,"_80":142,"_33":143,"_54":144},{"_47":48,"_53":135,"_49":136,"_51":137},{"_47":57,"_53":129,"_49":130,"_59":131},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[132],{"_49":133,"_26":134},"Tencent Hunyuan","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2","identity","Identity & attribution","The official model repository is owned by Tencent-Hunyuan. That organization links to hy.tencent.com. Use its actual brand image rather than an unrelated 3D icon.","image","projectMedia","Creator project media","/GameMap/media/demos/hunyuan3d-2.webp","Official Tencent Hunyuan3D 2.0 generation results showing cartoon character assets on a pink background","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2#%EF%B8%8F-hunyuan3d-20","Tencent Hunyuan · Hunyuan3D 2.0","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","Year","2025","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[86],"dimensions","Development stages",[160],"stages","Assets & animation","Topics",[164,165,166,167],"tags","Image-to-3D","Mesh","Textures","Blender","Further reading",[170,171,172],{"_49":177,"_26":178},{"_49":175,"_26":176},{"_49":173,"_26":174},"2.0 license","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2/blob/main/LICENSE","2.1 repository","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2.1","2.0 paper","https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12202","Project source",[181],{"_49":179,"_26":134},"Why it belongs here","The 2.0 pipeline generates shape with Hunyuan3D-DiT and textures the mesh with Hunyuan3D-Paint. It supports GLB and OBJ export and a Blender addon under a dedicated Tencent Hunyuan 3D 2.0 community license. The separate 2.1 release adds a PBR texture pipeline and training code. Topology, LOD, rigging, collision, runtime performance, and each version's terms still need game-pipeline checks.","detail","Resource type","Tool","Category","3D development","category","summary","name","tool",[198,199,200],[164,165,166,167],[103],[104],2025,{"_49":177,"_26":178},{"_49":175,"_26":176},{"_49":173,"_26":174},{"_202":203},"documents",{"_204":205,"_206":207},"en",[209,213,214,215,212,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,